Hello,
for all new Soulsborne (series Demon Souls, Dark Souls, Bloodborne) players:
if you really wanna to play any of soulsborne games, start with the Dark Souls 3. The most playable (not easiest), cool, for me is it the best soulsborne game.. But I'm writing here because of the Dark Souls 1. Why? It's good game, one of my loves, but the technical problems (optimalization) or sometimes fuc*ing playability.. Or some cool ideas but bad renders.. This game shows your real 'self'. Lot of rage, typically: "but game don't react" or "yea, i was rolling" etc. BUT: My first walkthrough was lovely, i enjoyed that, but when I started play it more now, it's nightmare, not about difficulty but the game itself can kill you, not the boss. Still recommenended. If you wanna challenge, do it. I was warning you. It will take some time to learn all that you need, but when you will go through of hard beginning you will love it. That 30th try at one boss.. And when you defeat him, soo lovely!

